So, then we can rely on pragmatics.=A0 To answer merely "something" is, by =
the Rule of Quantity, inadequate, if you have druthers.=A0 But, assuming --=
 as we always should -- that you are cooperating, this is adequate and, the=
refore, you have no preferences: "anything will do".




